menu "TWOFOLD DSP"

    choice TWOFOLD_SAT_OS
        prompt "Saturation oversampling"
        default TWOFOLD_SAT_OS_2
        help
            2x keeps aliasing below -138 dBc at musical drive (<= 12 dB) and costs ~13 % less CPU; with every effect
            on the chain then stays under 60 % of a core. 4x is cleaner only at extreme drive on loud HF content
            (-33..-47 dBc instead of -19..-22 dBc at 24 dB drive on a -6 dBFS 9-13 kHz sine), at ~+13 % CPU.
            See docs/test-results/dsp_tests.md.
        config TWOFOLD_SAT_OS_2
            bool "2x (96 kHz)"
        config TWOFOLD_SAT_OS_4
            bool "4x (192 kHz)"
    endchoice

endmenu
